%%{init: {"theme": "neutral", "flowchart": {"wrappingWidth": 400}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as You
  participant S as sbatch
  participant C as slurmctld
  participant N as slurmd<br/>(1st node)
  participant D as slurmdbd

  U->>S: sbatch my-job.slurm
  S->>C: script + SBATCH options
  C-->>S: accepted, job ID = 36
  S-->>U: Submitted batch job 36
  Note over C: PENDING<br/>waits in the queue
  C->>C: pick nodes
  C->>N: start the script
  Note over N: RUNNING<br/>Rscript my-script.R
  N-->>C: script ended (exit code)
  C->>D: record the job
  U->>C: squeue (queued or running)
  U->>D: sacct (finished)
